Total		3

Output: 3
Complexity Analysis
- Time Complexity: \(O(n)\) — two traversals of the array.
- Space Complexity: \(O(1)\) — only two extra variables.
Key difference from LeetCode 462:
- 462: You can increment or decrement → use the median.
- 3736: You can only increment → use the maximum element.
